theorem k215UnpairAt4631Reach16 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4631State k215PNum4638 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt4631State k215PNum4631 a b n c) $ = '(k215PReach_step k215UnpairAt4631Step16);

theorem k215UnpairAt4631CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4631State k215PNum4631 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt4631State k215PNum4631 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4631Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4631Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4631Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4631ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt4631Reach16))));
